# Payment Daily Digest — 07:30 UTC = 09:30 Africa/Gaborone.
#
# CFO 2026-08-09: "every day I need a cron somewhere around nine thirty AM,
# summarising all the payment requests. everything... and email to me one email.
# I have more than seven accountants requesting for payments, and it is too much
# overwhelming for me to go and check everything."
#
# One email, every open request, grouped by who loaded it and by company, with
# any duplicate override that has NOT been countersigned at the top in red —
# that is the control that failed on 7 Aug and let BWP 13,662.67 out twice.
#
# Sends EVERY day, including "nothing is waiting on you". A digest that only
# arrives when there is news cannot be told apart from one that has silently
# stopped — which is how the 07:00 manager report died six times unnoticed.
#
# The figures are computed by Omni. The AI only writes the plain-English read of
# them, and if it is unavailable the email still goes with a written fallback.
#
# Drop into /etc/cron.d/ (chmod 644, owned by root). Times are UTC.
SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin

30 7 * * * root cd /opt/alpha-finance && /usr/bin/docker compose --env-file /etc/alpha-finance/.env exec -T backend python manage.py payment_daily_digest >> /var/log/alpha-finance/payment-daily-digest.log 2>&1
